<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Monday's English</p>
<p>premier league soccer match:</p>
<p>Sunderland 2 (Rae 21st minute, penalty, Russell 61st)</p>
<p>Middlesbrough 2 (Emerson 18th, Ravanelli 53rd). Halftime 1-1.</p>
<p>Attendance 20,936.</p>
